---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---
<SiteLayout title="About RewardPath Guide" description="Learn about RewardPath Guide, an independent educational resource for understanding online rewards and gift card promotions." active="about">
  <section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><span class="section-kicker">ABOUT REWARDPATH</span><h1>Less confusion.<br /><em>More confidence.</em></h1><p>We make the fine print easier to understand.</p><div class="breadcrumb"><a href={base}>Home</a><span>/</span><span>About</span></div></div></section>
  <section class="prose-page section-space"><div class="container prose-container"><span class="section-kicker">WHY WE EXIST</span><h2>Online promotions should be <em>understandable.</em></h2><p>RewardPath Guide is an independent educational website focused on gift card promotions, rewards programs, sweepstakes, and online safety. Our goal is to explain common promotion formats and help readers identify the details worth checking before they participate.</p><p>We believe a useful guide should explain the difference between a chance to win and a guaranteed reward. It should encourage readers to verify the sponsor, read official rules, and protect personal information.</p><h2>What we do—and do not do</h2><ul><li>We publish educational articles and practical checklists.</li><li>We encourage readers to verify promotions directly with the named sponsor.</li><li>We do not issue gift cards or choose sweepstakes winners.</li><li>We do not promise that anyone will receive a prize or reward.</li><li>We are not affiliated with Cash App, retailers, gift card issuers, or other brands unless a page specifically says otherwise.</li></ul><h2>Editorial approach</h2><p>We aim to use clear language, avoid exaggerated claims, and update articles when information changes. Promotion terms can vary, so the official rules and sponsor information for an individual offer should always take priority over a general article.</p><p>Questions or corrections? Please visit our <a href={`${base}contact/`}>Contact page</a>.</p></div></section>
</SiteLayout>
